 # 🚀 SkillForge – Digital Career Portfolio & Professional Identity Platform

## 📖 Overview

SkillForge is a modern web platform designed to help students, fresh graduates, skilled professionals, freelancers, and job seekers create a complete digital professional identity.

Instead of relying on a traditional one-page resume, users can build a dynamic portfolio that showcases their education, technical skills, certifications, projects, achievements, work experience, and career goals in one place.

The platform enables recruiters, companies, and mentors to evaluate candidates through verified profiles, portfolios, and real-world project experience.

---

# 🎯 Problem Statement

Millions of students and professionals struggle to present their skills effectively.

Current problems include:

- Resumes become outdated quickly.
- Certificates are stored across multiple platforms.
- Freshers lack professional experience.
- Recruiters spend significant time verifying information.
- Portfolios are difficult to maintain.
- There is no single platform combining resumes, portfolios, certifications, and professional identity.

---

# 💡 Solution

SkillForge solves these problems by creating a centralized digital career ecosystem where users can build, manage, verify, and share their professional profiles.

Each user receives a personalized career dashboard that grows throughout their professional journey.

